WEBVTT

00:12.720 --> 00:15.920
[The construction site of Rongcheng Group]

00:20.190 --> 00:21.020
Gai,

00:21.510 --> 00:23.370
what did you do to offend the boss?

00:26.600 --> 00:28.290
Who said I offended the boss?

00:28.480 --> 00:29.830
Then why did you get sent to
the front line?

00:29.830 --> 00:30.390
Yeah.

00:32.640 --> 00:34.570
"Front line" is a good way to put it.

00:35.280 --> 00:36.320
They even matched you

00:36.320 --> 00:38.450
with a job that suits your profession.

00:39.390 --> 00:40.130
Come on.

00:40.350 --> 00:41.710
Even if I explain it to you,

00:41.710 --> 00:42.660
it's pointless.

00:42.880 --> 00:43.740
Let me tell you,

00:44.070 --> 00:45.160
not everyone

00:45.220 --> 00:45.920
can understand

00:45.920 --> 00:47.110
the boss's good intentions.

00:47.110 --> 00:47.670
You know?

00:48.350 --> 00:49.090
Is it this truck?

00:49.090 --> 00:50.150
Yes, yes, this one.

00:51.320 --> 00:52.390
Do I have to open the door myself?

00:52.390 --> 00:53.070
Coming.

00:54.390 --> 00:55.350
Gai, please.

00:57.000 --> 00:57.960
Watch out, Gai.

00:57.960 --> 00:58.760
You're rusty.

00:58.790 --> 00:59.350
Indeed.

00:59.350 --> 00:59.960
Gai, take care.

00:59.960 --> 01:00.560
Put it here.

01:00.560 --> 01:01.280
Here.

01:04.310 --> 01:04.790
Okay.

01:05.680 --> 01:06.280
Listen,

01:07.920 --> 01:09.840
don't say I didn't warn you.

01:09.840 --> 01:10.700
You guys,

01:11.230 --> 01:12.360
if you take care of me properly

01:12.360 --> 01:13.710
during this period,

01:14.000 --> 01:14.510
this is a crucial chance

01:14.510 --> 01:16.039
that could change your future.

01:16.039 --> 01:16.510
Got it?

01:16.510 --> 01:17.950
We must serve Gai well.

01:17.950 --> 01:18.350
Yes.

01:18.350 --> 01:19.280
We'll definitely take good care of you.

01:19.280 --> 01:20.740
Everyone, pay attention.

01:20.840 --> 01:21.789
Recently, someone has been

01:21.789 --> 01:23.039
scattering nails on the road again.

01:23.039 --> 01:23.789
Be careful when driving.

01:23.789 --> 01:25.120
Come, let me take a look.

01:26.590 --> 01:27.590
The tires are punctured.

01:27.590 --> 01:28.720
It's too dangerous.

01:29.000 --> 01:29.400
My god,

01:29.400 --> 01:30.900
how wicked.

01:31.480 --> 01:32.340
Pay attention.

01:32.590 --> 01:33.450
Pay attention.

01:34.120 --> 01:34.780
Go.

01:34.920 --> 01:35.430
Rest assured, Gai.

01:35.430 --> 01:36.280
All right, get to work.

01:36.280 --> 01:36.940
Get to work.

03:05.560 --> 03:09.290
[Born with Luck]

03:09.380 --> 03:12.310
[Episode 10]

03:32.630 --> 03:33.750
If Zheng Yongbing is

03:33.750 --> 03:35.610
really the man we're looking for,

03:36.000 --> 03:37.360
he is upstairs right now

03:37.360 --> 03:38.560
doing who knows what.

03:38.750 --> 03:40.520
And we can only sit in the car,

03:40.910 --> 03:43.240
staring out the window feeling helpless.

03:48.320 --> 03:50.579
How about I go up
and take a look right now?

03:51.240 --> 03:52.370
You can't go alone.

03:52.430 --> 03:54.079
If you're going, we go together.

03:54.079 --> 03:54.750
You keep an eye out here.

03:54.750 --> 03:55.950
I can handle it alone.

03:57.560 --> 03:58.579
I'm a veteran cop.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.680
I know what I'm doing.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.310
Besides, for something like this,

04:00.310 --> 04:00.840
I can't let

04:00.840 --> 04:01.870
a girl take the risk.

04:01.870 --> 04:02.470
Song Xing.

04:03.000 --> 04:03.600
Li Qian,

04:03.930 --> 04:04.860
know your place.

04:21.430 --> 04:22.830
Miss, come out quickly!

04:23.950 --> 04:25.190
-What kind of crappy elevator is this?
-You scared me.

04:25.190 --> 04:26.250
It's broken again.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.680
Call the property management.

04:27.680 --> 04:29.610
Have them come fix it immediately.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.150
There are so many photos—

05:25.430 --> 05:26.160
I don't believe

05:26.160 --> 05:27.560
we can't find a clear one.

05:34.430 --> 05:35.310
In his home

05:36.800 --> 05:38.330
it's like a constant feast,

05:39.870 --> 05:41.150
with the earth's milk,

05:42.240 --> 05:43.700
the lush green of forests,

05:45.120 --> 05:46.580
and the tears of the ocean.

05:49.360 --> 05:50.070
But,

05:51.040 --> 05:51.750
my friend,

05:53.600 --> 05:55.400
don't envy that kind of evil man.

05:56.510 --> 05:57.360
One day,

05:59.040 --> 06:00.480
the earth's milk…

06:03.750 --> 06:05.140
The earth's milk…

06:09.270 --> 06:10.330
The earth's…

06:15.000 --> 06:16.120
At his age,

06:16.560 --> 06:17.390
a decline in memory

06:17.390 --> 06:18.000
is normal.

06:19.310 --> 06:19.630
Milk.

06:19.630 --> 06:20.040
Beer.

06:21.390 --> 06:21.830
Beer.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.360
Hello, Chief.

06:26.630 --> 06:28.960
Didn't you say Zheng Yongbing
is on a diet?

06:29.040 --> 06:30.750
His breakfast and lunch are so plain.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.600
Why did he buy

06:31.750 --> 06:32.470
so much meat

06:32.510 --> 06:33.640
and beer for dinner?

06:36.020 --> 06:37.880
There's someone else in his room.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.010
You and Song Xing stay put.

06:40.010 --> 06:41.159
We'll be right there.

06:41.159 --> 06:42.090
But Song Xing...

06:42.120 --> 06:42.840
Stay put.

06:42.950 --> 06:43.680
Understood?

06:45.750 --> 06:46.480
Understood.

06:56.070 --> 06:56.920
Sorry.

06:56.950 --> 07:00.080
The subscriber you dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

07:31.510 --> 07:32.140
Liu!

07:32.630 --> 07:33.430
Sit down.

07:33.909 --> 07:34.310
Come.

07:40.310 --> 07:41.370
You must be hungry.

07:42.510 --> 07:44.170
There aren't any good dishes.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.840
Just have something simple.

07:48.240 --> 07:49.100
Help yourself.

07:49.870 --> 07:50.240
Come.

07:59.070 --> 07:59.670
Liu,

08:01.140 --> 08:02.360
what exactly did you

08:02.430 --> 08:03.760
come back for this time?

08:04.360 --> 08:05.160
To be honest,

08:06.070 --> 08:07.330
someone specifically

08:07.920 --> 08:09.800
invited me back

08:09.870 --> 08:11.470
to close a big deal this time.

08:12.390 --> 08:13.190
A big deal?

08:15.950 --> 08:16.750
What is it?

08:21.560 --> 08:22.360
Bianzhong.

08:22.950 --> 08:24.510
A full set of nine.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.340
My goodness.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.360
If you get caught,
that's a death sentence.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.760
And if I don't get caught?

08:29.680 --> 08:30.430
If I don't get caught,

08:30.430 --> 08:32.039
I can make 800,000 yuan.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.679
Wait, Liu.

08:35.120 --> 08:35.960
I mean,

08:36.720 --> 08:37.840
coming back this time

08:37.840 --> 08:38.960
is too risky.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.270
I heard the police

08:40.270 --> 08:42.330
have a 50,000  yuan reward out for you.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.770
I really need the money.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.670
Otherwise I wouldn't risk my life

08:49.670 --> 08:51.020
for 800,000 yuan.

08:54.630 --> 08:56.240
This time coming back to Sanjiangkou,

08:56.240 --> 08:58.080
I didn't even dare to
take public transport.

08:58.080 --> 09:00.340
I was afraid someone would recognize me.

09:00.510 --> 09:01.200
You see,

09:01.720 --> 09:03.180
I came back on a coal train.

09:04.240 --> 09:06.240
I didn't dare to go to a hotel either.

09:06.670 --> 09:07.870
So I had to come to you.

09:08.960 --> 09:09.870
My life

09:10.750 --> 09:12.320
is in your hands, brother.

09:18.670 --> 09:19.710
Don't worry.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.730
It's absolutely safe here.

09:23.790 --> 09:24.520
I believe it.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.040
I'm relieved.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.080
When this is over,

09:29.670 --> 09:31.270
I'll reward you handsomely.

09:31.910 --> 09:33.080
Don't mention it.

10:01.670 --> 10:02.480
Sorry,

10:02.510 --> 10:05.200
the subscriber you dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.400
Please redial later.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.050
What's going on?

10:17.320 --> 10:17.840
Liu,

10:18.080 --> 10:19.990
there's another advantage here.

10:20.080 --> 10:21.880
No one ever comes looking for me.

10:33.120 --> 10:33.810
It's fine.

10:33.910 --> 10:34.970
I'll go take a look.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.520
Who is it?

11:21.670 --> 11:23.270
Excuse me, Mr. Zheng.

11:24.020 --> 11:25.550
The downstairs tenant reported

11:25.550 --> 11:27.150
that there's a leak in their apartment.

11:27.150 --> 11:27.910
They suspect it's a problem

11:27.910 --> 11:29.130
with your bathroom,

11:29.270 --> 11:30.500
so I came to check.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.300
Okay.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.600
I'll go to the bathroom now

11:37.600 --> 11:38.760
and check it out!

11:42.790 --> 11:43.360
Come in.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.240
It's the property management.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.640
I don't really know them.

11:56.720 --> 11:58.400
How about I go down and take a look?

11:58.400 --> 12:00.000
What if it's really leaking?

12:02.270 --> 12:02.670
Okay.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.080
You go.

12:08.200 --> 12:10.210
The bathroom is indeed leaking.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.790
Is the leaking water

12:11.790 --> 12:13.350
blue?

12:15.550 --> 12:17.440
It seems a bit blue.

12:23.440 --> 12:24.180
Sorry.

12:24.440 --> 12:26.150
We will report it for repair right away.

12:26.150 --> 12:27.080
And you are?

12:28.000 --> 12:29.710
I... I am his friend.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.640
Why don't you

12:34.080 --> 12:35.460
call Mr. Zheng out,

12:35.630 --> 12:37.840
and we can go downstairs together
to take a look?

12:37.840 --> 12:39.440
He's inside turning off the water valve.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.700
It's dripping inside.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.650
Otherwise,

12:41.750 --> 12:43.750
you can come in and take a look first.

12:45.790 --> 12:46.660
Please come in.

12:47.030 --> 12:47.630
After you.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.260
Come on.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.960
Let's check the bathroom first.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.260
It's right over there.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.370
Can I ask you a question?

13:26.390 --> 13:28.060
Let's fix the leak first

13:28.600 --> 13:29.930
and check the bathroom.

13:30.630 --> 13:31.690
Don't be in a hurry.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.870
After you answer my question,

13:33.870 --> 13:35.330
I'll go wherever you want.

13:38.840 --> 13:39.360
Speak.

13:42.360 --> 13:43.330
Mr. Zheng,

13:44.120 --> 13:45.980
he wasn't in the bathroom, was he?

13:47.390 --> 13:48.960
He was lying in that room.

14:00.630 --> 14:02.300
If I hadn't been taking a shower,

14:02.300 --> 14:04.300
I would have been killed by you guys.

14:11.550 --> 14:14.000
You were so eager for me
to go to the bathroom,

14:14.000 --> 14:15.860
you must have had bad intentions.

15:12.990 --> 15:20.410
[First Inpatient Department]

15:36.000 --> 15:38.010
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

15:36.430 --> 15:37.970
The department plans
to make an exception and promote her.

15:37.970 --> 15:39.440
She needs a year of training.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.840
Keep an eye on her.

15:40.910 --> 15:42.600
Don't let anything happen to her.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.680
Your phone is ringing.

15:43.180 --> 15:43.690
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

15:45.240 --> 15:46.270
Wait, your phone is ringing.

15:46.270 --> 15:46.980
I know.

15:47.120 --> 15:47.920
G- Go quickly.

15:51.150 --> 15:51.770
Chief Qi,

15:51.960 --> 15:52.960
how is the situation?

15:52.960 --> 15:54.120
The suspect Zheng Yongbing

15:54.120 --> 15:55.340
took a hit to the head.

15:55.550 --> 15:57.000
It shouldn't be a serious issue.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.550
I didn't ask about him.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.350
How is Li Qian?

16:04.270 --> 16:05.000
Come with me.

16:07.170 --> 16:08.300
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

16:07.720 --> 16:08.600
Chief Zhang, your phone is ringing again.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.270
I know.

16:09.910 --> 16:10.510
Who is it?

16:13.080 --> 16:13.730
Answer it.

16:23.030 --> 16:24.000
It's just a superficial cut—

16:24.000 --> 16:24.860
four stitches.

16:27.750 --> 16:29.410
Then why is she still in a coma?

16:30.270 --> 16:31.750
Her blood pressure, heart rate, breathing—

16:31.750 --> 16:32.630
everything

16:32.670 --> 16:34.330
came back normal on the tests.

16:35.270 --> 16:35.990
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

16:36.550 --> 16:37.920
What exactly is going on?

16:37.920 --> 16:38.870
When we first came,

16:38.870 --> 16:39.840
she was fine.

16:40.080 --> 16:41.440
With such a big incident,

16:41.440 --> 16:43.360
I guess she's afraid of being criticized,

16:43.360 --> 16:44.420
so she's faking it.

16:48.150 --> 16:49.010
It's like this.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.620
If it's a real coma,

16:50.790 --> 16:52.190
the eyeballs won't move.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.080
If it's fake,

16:53.390 --> 16:54.480
when exposed to light,

16:54.480 --> 16:56.680
the eyeballs will definitely avoid it.

17:10.200 --> 17:11.790
Please pry her eyelids open.

17:11.790 --> 17:12.380
No need,

17:12.589 --> 17:14.720
you can just shine the light directly.

17:39.510 --> 17:40.310
Hello, Mentor.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.110
Zhang Yi'ang,

17:41.550 --> 17:42.480
what's going on?

17:42.750 --> 17:43.310
Before you left,

17:43.310 --> 17:44.550
what did I tell you?

17:45.920 --> 17:47.850
Mentor, you're so well-informed.

17:48.550 --> 17:50.010
Say hello to Director Gao.

17:53.720 --> 17:54.790
Mentor, don't worry.

17:54.790 --> 17:55.350
Nothing happened;

17:55.350 --> 17:56.240
Li Qian is perfectly fine.

17:56.240 --> 17:57.300
How can I not worry?

17:57.920 --> 17:59.000
Hearing that from you

17:59.000 --> 18:00.640
makes me even less reassured.

18:00.640 --> 18:01.370
Cut the crap.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.160
Start a video call.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.420
I need to see it myself.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.430
That's enough.

18:16.140 --> 18:16.810
Mentor,

18:17.880 --> 18:18.440
look.

18:21.340 --> 18:23.010
[Switch to voice chat]

18:22.550 --> 18:23.820
Why isn't she moving?

18:24.480 --> 18:25.680
You call this "fine"?

18:28.110 --> 18:29.030
I won't pursue

18:29.030 --> 18:31.090
your unauthorized action this time.

18:31.790 --> 18:32.820
Director Gao!

18:32.680 --> 18:33.900
[Switch to voice chat]

18:33.130 --> 18:33.890
Li Qian.

18:34.160 --> 18:35.590
How is it? Are you okay?

18:35.680 --> 18:36.650
I'm fine.

18:39.830 --> 18:41.310
Has the suspect's identity been found out?

18:41.310 --> 18:42.830
The surveillance footage is too blurry
to make out his face.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.070
We were just about to
conduct an intensive interrogation

18:44.070 --> 18:46.510
when Zheng Yongbing
started pretending to be unconscious.

18:46.510 --> 18:48.510
I can tolerate Li Qian faking a coma.

18:48.510 --> 18:50.840
Can I tolerate Zheng Yongbing faking one?

18:52.240 --> 18:52.830
Chief Qi,

18:53.110 --> 18:53.960
anyway, Li Qian is fine.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.160
You should go back early.

18:55.160 --> 18:55.620
Well...

18:56.790 --> 18:57.370
How do you

18:57.510 --> 18:59.570
plan to interrogate Zheng Yongbing?

19:00.200 --> 19:01.460
I have to make him talk.

19:02.590 --> 19:03.650
Calm down.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.720
Make sure you don't break the rules.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.940
As long as the facts exist,

19:08.110 --> 19:09.620
the masks will be torn off.

19:10.880 --> 19:11.610
Don't worry.

19:15.830 --> 19:17.290
Thanks for your hard work.

19:17.320 --> 19:17.650
Okay.

19:21.070 --> 19:22.270
Which room? Let's go.

19:23.300 --> 19:28.110
[Inpatient Department]

19:27.750 --> 19:36.480
♪ Snow blankets the Volga River ♪

19:48.000 --> 19:48.660
Did he move?

19:48.750 --> 19:49.290
Yes.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.310
His eyes didn't move on my side.

19:51.310 --> 19:52.110
It did on mine.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.660
Peel his eyelids open.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.800
Wait, did I go to the wrong room?

20:00.590 --> 20:01.850
What's his condition?

20:04.160 --> 20:05.550
Blunt-force injury with a laceration.

20:05.550 --> 20:06.880
He's had four stitches.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.620
Then why is he in a coma too?

20:09.830 --> 20:11.680
His blood pressure, heart rate, breathing—

20:11.680 --> 20:12.900
all test results

20:13.350 --> 20:14.310
are normal.

20:15.590 --> 20:16.310
So we've moved directly

20:16.310 --> 20:17.110
to this stage.

20:17.680 --> 20:18.880
For a situation like his,

20:18.880 --> 20:20.740
how can I wake him up immediately?

20:20.960 --> 20:22.170
There are many ways.

20:22.510 --> 20:23.490
But...

20:23.880 --> 20:25.010
Let's talk outside.

21:03.350 --> 21:04.010
Put it away.

21:05.160 --> 21:05.550
Sit.

21:08.510 --> 21:09.510
Get out of the way.

21:10.720 --> 21:11.520
You got nerve.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.400
Who hit you over the head?

21:22.200 --> 21:22.930
I don't know.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.480
No.

21:23.790 --> 21:24.750
I don't know him.

21:25.400 --> 21:28.400
You don't recognize him,
but he goes to your place to eat?

21:28.400 --> 21:29.790
He's... He's just a customer

21:29.790 --> 21:30.760
at the store.

21:31.030 --> 21:32.790
He occasionally asked me out for a drink.

21:32.790 --> 21:33.790
That's how we met.

21:34.070 --> 21:35.110
I call him Liu.

21:36.310 --> 21:36.910
That's...

21:37.270 --> 21:38.570
That's all I know.

21:38.960 --> 21:40.090
Liu's his full name?

21:41.240 --> 21:41.790
Liu Bei.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.400
Is his courtesy name Xuande?

21:43.400 --> 21:44.460
You better behave!

21:44.480 --> 21:45.680
"Bei" as in "houbei"?

21:45.880 --> 21:47.340
It's "Bei" as in "houbei".

21:47.750 --> 21:48.950
"Bei" as in "beihou".

21:49.030 --> 21:49.480
This

21:49.590 --> 21:50.420
Bei.

21:51.160 --> 21:52.910
Is that Liu Bei—

21:53.400 --> 21:54.480
the tomb raider

21:54.480 --> 21:55.610
who scams scammers?

21:57.640 --> 21:59.440
You even know this, Chief Zhang?

22:01.380 --> 22:03.830
He's a fugitive wanted
under a Ministry of Public Security order.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.550
The department has been

22:04.550 --> 22:06.210
tracking him all these years.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.440
A few years ago, this Liu Bei

22:07.440 --> 22:08.690
set up a Ponzi scheme.

22:09.200 --> 22:10.090
Impressive.

22:10.240 --> 22:11.310
He claimed

22:11.640 --> 22:12.510
he had already tunneled into

22:12.510 --> 22:14.680
the burial chamber
of First Emperor of Qin's mausoleum.

22:14.680 --> 22:16.440
Many people lost their life savings

22:16.440 --> 22:17.520
to his scams.

22:17.750 --> 22:19.010
Families were ruined.

22:19.640 --> 22:20.310
A few people were upset,

22:20.310 --> 22:21.030
went looking for him,

22:21.030 --> 22:22.400
and he stabbed two of them to death.

22:22.400 --> 22:24.600
You've got a whole archive in your head.

22:24.680 --> 22:25.920
Does... Does this count as

22:25.920 --> 22:27.030
harboring a wanted criminal?

22:27.030 --> 22:28.290
It definitely counts.

22:29.200 --> 22:29.590
No.

22:30.110 --> 22:31.950
I... I didn't want to!

22:32.200 --> 22:33.600
He suddenly came to me.

22:33.680 --> 22:35.110
He's a reckless guy.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.590
How could I refuse?

22:37.920 --> 22:38.960
Harboring a wanted criminal is now...

22:38.960 --> 22:40.590
It is punishable by up to
three years in prison,

22:40.590 --> 22:41.790
or criminal detention
or public surveillance;

22:41.790 --> 22:43.550
in serious cases, it's three to ten years.

22:43.550 --> 22:44.200
No.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.230
Officers!

22:45.830 --> 22:47.230
I don't want to go to jail!

22:47.350 --> 22:48.440
I know the policy.

22:49.110 --> 22:50.680
Ask whatever you want.

22:51.160 --> 22:51.880
As long as I know,

22:51.880 --> 22:52.920
I'll tell you everything.

22:52.920 --> 22:54.550
I was really threatened by him.

22:54.550 --> 22:55.640
Where is he now?

22:56.350 --> 22:57.080
I don't know.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.000
But I know

22:58.000 --> 22:59.400
he arrived by hopping on a coal train.

22:59.400 --> 23:00.790
He took a shower at my place,

23:00.790 --> 23:02.510
leaving black water everywhere.

23:02.510 --> 23:04.070
Why did he come to Sanjiangkou?

23:04.070 --> 23:05.030
He said

23:05.240 --> 23:07.920
someone wanted to
buy a set of bianzhong from him.

23:07.920 --> 23:08.960
He had the bianzhong.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.640
He was acting as a middleman this time.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.830
He said after it's done,

23:11.830 --> 23:13.090
he'd get a commission.

23:14.110 --> 23:16.110
Do you know the transaction amount?

23:16.160 --> 23:17.490
I don't know about that.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.300
Is that all?

23:22.240 --> 23:22.900
That's all.

23:31.030 --> 23:32.680
But according to our intel,

23:33.830 --> 23:36.030
you're involved in more than just this.

23:40.720 --> 23:41.780
What else is there?

23:46.770 --> 23:48.100
I'll be honest with you.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.960
That matter has been traced to you.

23:54.310 --> 23:54.880
Otherwise,

23:54.880 --> 23:57.410
did you think we invited you
for dinner today?

23:58.070 --> 23:58.960
We didn't come here today

23:58.960 --> 23:59.960
for Liu Bei.

24:00.310 --> 24:01.350
He's just a side note.

24:01.350 --> 24:02.530
We are here for you.

24:05.680 --> 24:06.160
Go on.

24:11.440 --> 24:12.640
You speak, or I speak?

24:14.000 --> 24:14.930
I'll say it then.

24:17.310 --> 24:18.720
I… I did suspect

24:18.720 --> 24:21.050
there was something wrong with those two.

24:23.070 --> 24:23.980
Are you done?

24:24.240 --> 24:26.040
Tell us the whole process, okay?

24:27.640 --> 24:28.440
Not long ago,

24:28.880 --> 24:31.070
two men in their thirties

24:31.750 --> 24:33.000
suddenly showed up at my door

24:33.000 --> 24:34.720
and asked if I wanted to buy some stuff.

24:34.720 --> 24:36.380
They gave me some gold jewelry

24:36.550 --> 24:38.460
and a fake God of Wealth statue.

24:38.750 --> 24:39.830
I suspected at the time

24:39.830 --> 24:41.290
that the stuff was stolen.

24:41.350 --> 24:43.400
But they threatened me with a knife.

24:43.550 --> 24:44.410
Officers.

24:44.590 --> 24:46.110
I'm a victim too.

24:46.270 --> 24:47.590
Why are you always getting threatened?

24:47.590 --> 24:48.590
Exactly.

24:48.590 --> 24:49.080
I'm just

24:49.110 --> 24:50.000
out of luck.

24:50.030 --> 24:50.630
And then?

24:51.440 --> 24:52.200
Then,

24:52.480 --> 24:53.550
to cut my losses,

24:53.550 --> 24:54.480
I sold the stuff.

24:55.030 --> 24:55.920
To whom?

24:56.070 --> 24:56.680
Zhou Qi,

24:57.640 --> 24:58.640
the PR manager of

24:58.640 --> 24:59.970
Fenglinwan Nightclub.

25:01.200 --> 25:03.310
And that fake God of Wealth statue—

25:03.310 --> 25:04.750
I sold it to Hu Jianren

25:04.750 --> 25:06.010
from Rongcheng Group.

25:06.750 --> 25:08.080
I got 60,000 yuan for it.

25:08.590 --> 25:10.790
What about the people who sold it to you?

25:23.590 --> 25:25.120
Find someone immediately.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.550
Based on Zheng Yongbing's description,

25:26.550 --> 25:27.750
get the sketches of these two suspects

25:27.750 --> 25:28.400
done first.

25:28.400 --> 25:28.790
Okay.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.460
Where is Song Xing?

25:32.720 --> 25:33.120
Chief.

25:34.790 --> 25:35.610
Song Xing.

25:36.110 --> 25:37.680
Li Qian was afraid you'd be in danger,

25:37.680 --> 25:38.480
so she went in.

25:39.030 --> 25:39.510
Right?

25:40.070 --> 25:40.550
No.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.350
I didn't want her to take risks,

25:42.350 --> 25:43.550
so I didn't let her go up.

25:43.550 --> 25:44.070
But later,

25:44.070 --> 25:44.790
I have no idea

25:44.790 --> 25:45.880
why she went up by herself.

25:45.880 --> 25:46.590
Talk less.

25:49.960 --> 25:51.890
Did you find anything at the scene?

25:51.920 --> 25:52.310
Yes.

25:55.960 --> 25:56.400
Chief,

26:01.440 --> 26:02.840
this is the suspect's backpack.

26:02.600 --> 26:05.540
[Jinshui Pavilion]

26:02.960 --> 26:04.960
There are only a few clothes inside.

26:05.830 --> 26:07.030
It's cursive script.

26:07.720 --> 26:08.540
Hegegao.

26:08.720 --> 26:09.720
Jinshui Pavilion.

26:09.720 --> 26:12.120
It should be pronounced Jinshui Pavilion.

26:18.920 --> 26:19.980
Jinshui Pavilion.

26:25.680 --> 26:27.540
Song Xing, come here for a second.

26:32.830 --> 26:35.850
[Inpatient Department]

26:36.570 --> 26:39.130
Look what you've done!

26:41.270 --> 26:42.670
What are you laughing at?

26:42.830 --> 26:45.790
[Protect the environment,
safeguard our home.]

26:50.070 --> 26:52.200
Do I have to teach you how to open a door?

27:03.090 --> 27:04.520
No need.

27:04.550 --> 27:05.680
I'll open it for you.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.030
[Protect the environment,
safeguard our home.]

27:07.720 --> 27:08.850
This is exhausting.

27:20.960 --> 27:21.430
Sit.

27:25.000 --> 27:25.440
Tea?

27:28.350 --> 27:28.880
Coffee?

27:30.590 --> 27:32.200
Come, have some snacks.

27:32.800 --> 27:34.540
Spit it out.

27:41.240 --> 27:42.040
Kai,

27:43.030 --> 27:45.000
I wasn't joking about

27:45.030 --> 27:46.480
what I told you last time.

27:47.310 --> 27:47.720
No, no.

27:48.400 --> 27:50.000
Let me finish.

27:50.030 --> 27:51.030
What's the rush?

27:51.640 --> 27:52.550
Have a seat.

27:55.200 --> 27:57.530
This matter is extremely important to me.

27:58.480 --> 27:59.240
You know

27:59.960 --> 28:00.590
I am someone

28:00.590 --> 28:02.190
who has always been upright.

28:02.500 --> 28:03.630
You are just stupid.

28:03.640 --> 28:04.640
You've got such a good position

28:04.640 --> 28:06.680
and you don't even know how to
line your own pockets.

28:06.680 --> 28:08.540
No wonder my sister divorced you.

28:08.880 --> 28:10.740
I guess it's just my personality.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.570
Right now, a bunch of corrupt officials

28:15.570 --> 28:16.520
want to oust me

28:16.550 --> 28:18.400
and transfer me to the provincial capital.

28:18.400 --> 28:18.920
Then,

28:19.270 --> 28:19.790
they'd use

28:19.790 --> 28:21.440
the position of
Director of the Administrative Committee

28:21.440 --> 28:22.900
to line their own pockets.

28:23.200 --> 28:23.680
Tell me,

28:24.240 --> 28:25.840
how could I let them succeed?

28:26.000 --> 28:27.500
As for making money,

28:27.720 --> 28:28.680
you can work together.

28:28.680 --> 28:29.030
No.

28:30.110 --> 28:32.170
I absolutely will not do such a thing.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.730
The only way I can think of

28:37.830 --> 28:39.640
to stop them right now

28:39.680 --> 28:40.610
is to have you...

28:41.750 --> 28:42.160
No.

28:42.750 --> 28:43.480
Please

28:43.960 --> 28:44.790
injure me.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.160
If you think

28:47.510 --> 28:49.370
I didn't pay you enough last time,

28:51.030 --> 28:51.890
you can take any

28:52.960 --> 28:54.090
of the old furniture

28:54.310 --> 28:55.710
and antiques in my house,

28:56.030 --> 28:57.090
whatever you want.

28:57.110 --> 28:58.310
I don't collect junk.

29:00.550 --> 29:02.860
My ancestors had some money.

29:03.920 --> 29:05.960
These are all genuine

29:05.960 --> 29:07.440
antiques.

29:12.480 --> 29:13.270
Slow down.

29:14.510 --> 29:16.270
If this was really made of
yellow rosewood,

29:16.270 --> 29:17.550
then it would indeed be valuable.

29:17.550 --> 29:19.350
But with your cheap firewood...

29:20.070 --> 29:21.440
But what if it really is

29:21.440 --> 29:22.480
yellow rosewood?

29:29.510 --> 29:31.000
If it really was yellow rosewood,

29:31.000 --> 29:31.830
my sister wouldn't have

29:31.830 --> 29:33.170
divorced you.

29:34.400 --> 29:34.830
Okay.

29:35.550 --> 29:36.680
Alright, so these pieces of furniture
aren't worth much—

29:36.680 --> 29:38.540
you probably don't care for them.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.070
I am a man of culture.

29:40.510 --> 29:42.880
These paintings
and calligraphy on the wall

29:42.880 --> 29:44.680
must be worth something, right?

29:45.240 --> 29:45.680
Kai,

29:46.720 --> 29:47.870
pick any painting

29:48.830 --> 29:49.690
you like at home

29:51.000 --> 29:51.660
and take it.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.770
What about this one?

29:57.160 --> 29:58.160
Good eye.

29:58.880 --> 29:59.740
It's by Guo Bin.

30:01.030 --> 30:02.490
Look at this handwriting.

30:08.110 --> 30:09.640
And who is that one by?

30:12.030 --> 30:13.030
By Ding Guanpeng.

30:14.680 --> 30:16.270
I also have one by Wen Zhengming.

30:16.270 --> 30:17.470
I'll go get it for you.

30:17.640 --> 30:18.440
Wait a minute.

30:19.160 --> 30:20.160
Who is this one by?

30:20.640 --> 30:21.740
That one is a fake.

30:26.160 --> 30:28.190
It's a fake, not worth anything.

30:29.550 --> 30:30.290
Let me see.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.070
Yu Yueran?

30:36.880 --> 30:38.510
I've heard of this person.

30:38.510 --> 30:39.640
His calligraphy is very valuable.

30:39.640 --> 30:41.070
Yes, the real ones are valuable.

30:41.070 --> 30:42.160
This one is a fake.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.560
It's not worth anything.

30:45.040 --> 30:46.070
I want this one.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.920
It's fake.

30:48.960 --> 30:50.480
I like fakes.

30:51.790 --> 30:52.270
Okay?

30:54.440 --> 30:55.030
Okay.

30:57.440 --> 30:58.480
Well, tonight,

30:58.550 --> 30:59.400
I'll break your arm

30:59.400 --> 31:00.790
at the entrance of the committee office.

31:00.790 --> 31:02.310
It takes a hundred days
to recover from a broken bone.

31:02.310 --> 31:03.680
At that point, who's going to force you

31:03.680 --> 31:04.680
to transfer to the provincial capital?

31:04.680 --> 31:05.640
Even with your arm in a sling,

31:05.640 --> 31:06.590
you can still go to work.

31:06.590 --> 31:07.590
What do you think?

31:07.960 --> 31:09.490
If you think it's suitable,

31:09.750 --> 31:11.810
I definitely have no problem with it.

31:23.720 --> 31:24.330
Bro,

31:24.790 --> 31:26.160
the big truck is trying to overtake us.

31:26.160 --> 31:27.110
If I let him overtake us,

31:27.110 --> 31:29.110
I'll change my name to Fang Beichao.

31:32.870 --> 31:35.820
♪ Stars are twinkling over Crescent Bay ♪

31:39.820 --> 31:44.440
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

31:42.830 --> 31:44.230
Bro, you're impressive.

31:47.140 --> 31:50.300
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

31:49.240 --> 31:49.760
Bro,

31:49.790 --> 31:51.520
the big truck has overtaken us.

31:54.030 --> 31:57.110
♪ Sneaking around, peeking through ♪

31:54.130 --> 31:55.660
Overtaken Fang, chase him!

31:56.480 --> 31:58.600
Chase him.

32:03.400 --> 32:04.030
Okay.

32:16.830 --> 32:17.890
What's wrong, bro?

32:31.590 --> 32:31.830
Bro,

32:31.830 --> 32:33.880
right now I just want to go up and ram it.

32:33.880 --> 32:35.090
That's a truck.

32:35.160 --> 32:35.680
If we ram it,

32:35.680 --> 32:37.340
that would be a fatal mistake.

32:37.640 --> 32:38.740
Bro, you're right.

32:39.030 --> 32:40.160
Our "tool" really

32:40.240 --> 32:41.910
does need upgrading.

32:42.000 --> 32:42.750
I did say

32:42.750 --> 32:44.720
that sharpening the axe
won't delay chopping wood.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.000
But now it won't start.

32:46.030 --> 32:48.230
Are we going to carry it to get upgraded?

32:48.550 --> 32:51.590
Snow covers the Volga River.

32:52.030 --> 32:54.160
Troikas run on the frozen river.

32:54.200 --> 32:55.200
Troikas.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.160
Weren't you driving pretty fast?

33:27.160 --> 33:28.270
Why did you stop here?

33:28.270 --> 33:29.200
Come on, chase me!

33:29.200 --> 33:29.720
Come on!

33:29.960 --> 33:30.310
Come on!

33:30.310 --> 33:31.000
Come on, get out.

33:31.000 --> 33:31.590
Get out.

33:33.160 --> 33:33.710
You...

33:42.200 --> 33:42.920
Bro,

33:44.350 --> 33:45.740
you need a tire repair.

33:46.270 --> 33:47.460
It's cheap here.

33:51.400 --> 33:52.070
Mao.

33:53.200 --> 33:53.880
Mao.

33:57.160 --> 33:57.960
Mao!

34:07.750 --> 34:11.630
[No swimming.]

34:13.150 --> 34:13.840
Back then,

34:16.590 --> 34:18.520
when I first came from the village,

34:20.760 --> 34:22.560
I had no education and no skills,

34:24.000 --> 34:25.530
and couldn't find any work.

34:27.690 --> 34:29.570
I was about to starve.

34:31.880 --> 34:32.739
It was you, Mao,

34:34.030 --> 34:35.360
and Gang who took me in.

34:42.550 --> 34:44.210
Coming here means stability.

34:44.639 --> 34:46.060
[Xia Tinggang, Thief]

34:44.960 --> 34:46.760
I'll give you 3,500 yuan a month.

34:47.020 --> 34:47.929
[Mao Hongwei, Thief]

34:50.150 --> 34:50.590
Right.

34:51.110 --> 34:53.040
And food and lodging are included.

34:54.400 --> 34:55.280
Gang, Mao,

34:55.360 --> 34:56.960
whatever works. You decide.

34:58.230 --> 34:58.880
This Gai...

34:58.880 --> 35:00.350
Little Gai is good.

35:01.280 --> 35:02.740
Not only did you take me in,

35:05.280 --> 35:06.480
but you also taught me

35:07.360 --> 35:09.290
the rules of survival in this city.

35:10.850 --> 35:11.250
What?

35:11.280 --> 35:13.070
-Where should we go to
grab a bite and have a drink?
-Bro, let's get some barbecue.

35:13.070 --> 35:14.270
-Bro.
-“Have a drink.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.070
Wait, why...

35:15.110 --> 35:16.370
Why is it only 400 yuan?

35:17.110 --> 35:18.000
Wasn't it 3,500 yuan?

35:18.000 --> 35:19.030
Wait, you eat my food
and sleep in my place.

35:19.030 --> 35:20.090
It all costs money.

35:20.960 --> 35:21.560
Wait, bro.

35:21.960 --> 35:23.430
I did all the work myself.

35:25.190 --> 35:27.120
Do you even have a conscience, Gai?

35:27.440 --> 35:29.360
Do you know

35:29.360 --> 35:30.420
what gratitude is?

35:30.760 --> 35:32.220
If it weren't for you guys,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.440
I wouldn't have gone down

35:35.440 --> 35:36.630
the path I'm on now.

35:44.030 --> 35:44.590
Gai,

35:47.710 --> 35:49.230
spare me, please.

35:50.800 --> 35:51.400
Mao,

35:52.510 --> 35:54.040
what are you talking about?

35:55.600 --> 35:57.060
I'm showing my gratitude.

36:00.710 --> 36:01.630
But let's

36:01.670 --> 36:03.530
put our personal feelings aside.

36:04.920 --> 36:06.780
You punctured our company's car;

36:07.320 --> 36:08.440
you still have to pay for it.

36:08.440 --> 36:09.040
Of course,

36:09.190 --> 36:09.790
I will pay.

36:09.800 --> 36:10.600
100,000 yuan.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.670
How much?

36:11.760 --> 36:12.480
Too much?

36:14.110 --> 36:14.770
Just right.

36:17.990 --> 36:19.430
100,000 yuan?

36:19.710 --> 36:21.070
100,000 yuan, you...

36:22.190 --> 36:22.840
Gai.

36:23.630 --> 36:24.320
Lord Gai!

36:25.400 --> 36:26.700
I'm really begging you.

36:26.700 --> 36:27.440
Forget 100,000 yuan.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.230
I don't even have 500 yuan

36:28.230 --> 36:29.700
on me.

36:30.550 --> 36:32.280
It's not that I don't want to
pay my respects to you.

36:32.280 --> 36:32.740
This...

36:33.550 --> 36:34.550
Even if I go out to borrow,

36:34.550 --> 36:36.150
no one will lend me any money.

36:36.480 --> 36:37.010
Lord Gai.

36:37.710 --> 36:38.190
Mao,

36:38.880 --> 36:39.810
don't be afraid,

36:41.000 --> 36:41.800
I'm here.

36:43.970 --> 36:47.110
[IOU] [Borrower: Mao Hongwei]

36:50.160 --> 36:52.310
[Yang Wei—private money lender]

37:03.230 --> 37:06.340
[IOU] [Borrower: Mao Hongwei]

37:06.710 --> 37:07.230
Mao.

37:17.790 --> 37:19.350
[IOU] [Borrower: Mao Hongwei]

37:33.640 --> 37:34.700
The money is yours.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.000
You paid me back.

37:47.360 --> 37:47.960
Yours.

37:49.070 --> 37:50.480
What are you doing?

37:50.480 --> 37:51.000
Take it.

37:52.590 --> 37:54.170
We agreed on this.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.510
I thought you were joking.

37:57.510 --> 37:57.960
What are you doing?

37:57.960 --> 37:58.950
Take it back.

37:59.190 --> 37:59.590
Wait,

38:00.190 --> 38:01.790
why are you pushing it?

38:01.880 --> 38:02.760
Looking down on me?

38:02.760 --> 38:03.550
Stop pushing.

38:03.550 --> 38:05.230
What are you doing? You...

38:06.880 --> 38:08.280
Gai, if you're going to do this...

38:08.280 --> 38:08.950
What?

38:10.230 --> 38:11.190
If you have any other friends
who need money,

38:11.190 --> 38:12.850
introduce them to me anytime.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.930
I'll lend them whatever they need.

38:18.550 --> 38:20.150
Let's go. I'll give you a ride

38:20.190 --> 38:21.070
to get some help.

38:21.070 --> 38:21.910
That's great.

38:26.000 --> 38:26.480
Mao,

38:27.360 --> 38:29.420
we haven't seen each other for years.

38:30.400 --> 38:31.320
I don't really have

38:31.320 --> 38:32.780
anything good to give you.

38:34.230 --> 38:35.090
Just a stack...

38:36.110 --> 38:36.800
Take this.

38:38.110 --> 38:39.440
I've had this with me for a few days.

38:39.440 --> 38:40.800
I've grown attached to it.

38:40.800 --> 38:41.460
You take it.

38:41.950 --> 38:42.480
Take it.

38:44.630 --> 38:45.890
Take care of yourself.

38:49.760 --> 38:51.050
Th-Thank you.
